		"kind": "object",
		"command": "ld -o prog a.o",
		"request": "a.o has no .bss at all. `buf` is STT_OBJECT with st_shndx = SHN_COMMON (0xfff2), st_size = 64 and st_value = 16 — and that 16 is the *alignment*, not an offset into anything",
